<section id="about" class="page-gutter border-t border-border py-[var(--space-3xl)]" aria-label="About ALTR">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[var(--content-max)] grid-cols-1 gap-[var(--space-xl)] min-[900px]:grid-cols-[12rem_1fr] min-[900px]:gap-[var(--space-3xl)]">
    <div class="fade-up flex items-baseline justify-between gap-[var(--space-md)] min-[900px]:sticky min-[900px]:top-[calc(var(--nav-h)+var(--space-lg))] min-[900px]:self-start min-[900px]:flex-col min-[900px]:items-start min-[900px]:justify-start">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <p class="mono text-[var(--text-xs)] tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-muted">§ 02</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="display fade-up max-w-[32ch] text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.75rem)] italic leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.015em]">
        A specialty matcha cafe. Single-cultivar, carefully blended, served with precision.
      </h2>
      <div class="fade-up mt-[var(--space-xl)] grid max-w-[38rem] gap-[var(--space-md)] mono text-[var(--text-sm)] leading-[1.7] text-ink">
        <p>
          ALTR opened with a narrow mandate — to source matcha directly from the people
          who grow it, and to serve it the way the leaf asks to be served. We don't
          chase volume. We list a small number of blends, change them with the harvest,
          and ground every tin the morning we pour it.
        </p>
        <p>
          The cupping notes on this menu are honest. The prices reflect the work in the
          field, not the work in the cafe. If you are new to matcha, we are happy to
          walk you through the menu. If you are not, you already know what to order.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
